    "explanation": "The scheduler is a deterministic state machine. A pending job's priority is recomputed from its unchanged arrival time; selection compares effective priority first, then insertion rank. A run consumes only the selected job and discards unused budget after completion. Counterexample: changing the initial clock from zero violates the required initial state.",
